WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.106 --> 00:00:01.628
Oh no!

2
00:00:01.575 --> 00:00:05.362
A brand new neighborhood, and every gate is wide open!

3
00:00:05.362 --> 00:00:08.825
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:08.825 --> 00:00:11.600
This is Episode 66.

5
00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:13.550
Meet the lighthouse.

6
00:00:13.550 --> 00:00:15.987
Its beam sweeps the new land.

7
00:00:15.987 --> 00:00:17.625
Fences!

8
00:00:17.625 --> 00:00:19.075
Lamps!

9
00:00:19.075 --> 00:00:20.987
Back doors lock.

10
00:00:20.987 --> 00:00:23.012
Safe from day one.

11
00:00:23.013 --> 00:00:25.650
The muddy blob bonks the fence.

12
00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:26.963
Nope!

13
00:00:26.963 --> 00:00:28.937
Need another neighborhood?

14
00:00:28.937 --> 00:00:30.337
Shine!

15
00:00:30.337 --> 00:00:33.625
The same safe setup, every single time.

16
00:00:33.625 --> 00:00:36.013
The lighthouse keeps watching.

17
00:00:36.013 --> 00:00:39.012
Green, green, green... red!

18
00:00:39.012 --> 00:00:40.975
One gate is open.

19
00:00:40.975 --> 00:00:43.412
Maya runs and closes it.

20
00:00:43.412 --> 00:00:45.062
Green again.

21
00:00:45.063 --> 00:00:46.900
Set up safe.

22
00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:48.663
Stay safe.

23
00:00:48.663 --> 00:00:50.775
That is the lighthouse.

24
00:00:50.775 --> 00:00:53.900
Now you know AWS Control Tower!

25
00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:57.700
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

